gimlet-eye-toolkit (0.7.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Local API requires a per-installation token, bound to loopback.
  * Sealed keystore, X25519 recipients in container v3, OpenPGP interop.
  * Pack conformance runner, pack trust pinning, golden scrub corpus.
  * Live-engine UI tests, recorded benchmarks, reproducible builds, packaging.
  * User guide, admin guide, and pack gallery.

